cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DiamondBench, please cite it as below."
title: "DiamondBench: an open benchmark of AI answer-engine accuracy on diamond and gemology questions"
abstract: >-
  47 buyer-phrased diamond and gemology questions with a public, sourced answer key
  and a deterministic pass, partial, or fail grading rule. The benchmark measures
  how accurately AI answer engines respond to shoppers and includes raw answers,
  dated results, and reproducible grading code.
type: dataset
authors:
